'''Boots''' is an [[item class]] of armour pieces that can contain up to four [[socket]]s. 

==Types of boots==
There are 6 main sub-types of boots: 
* 3 '''pure''' sub-types which require single [[attribute]] and provide associated defense type.
* 3 '''hybrid''' sub-types which require two [[attributes]] and provide both of the associated defense types; at the cost of having both attributes required and defenses provided sightly lower then the ''pure'' counterpart

[[Version 3.15.0]] introduced a 7th sub-type of boots that utilizes a new Defence known as [[Ward]]. These new basetypes require an equal amount of each Attribute to equip.

